    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 13 Blackthorn Hill View to the market — a superb three-bedroom mid-terrace family home ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Blackthorn Hill development in Rathcoole, County Dublin.\nExtending to c.99 sq.m., this spacious home offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation across two floors and is an ideal choice for first-time buyers, young families and investors alike.\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a generous living room and a bright kitchen/dining area with access to the private rear garden as well as an understairs bathroom. Upstairs are three well-proportioned bedrooms, a main family bathroom & master bedroom ensuite.\nThe property further benefits from a private rear garden, providing an excellent outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining and family use.\nThe B3 energy rating is another standout feature, offering excellent energy efficiency and the potential to qualify for a green mortgage.\nThe location is superb, with Rathcoole village just a short distance away and a wealth of amenities within easy reach, including schools, shops, cafés, restaurants and local services. The area is well serviced by public transport, while the nearby M50 and N7 provide easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. A wide selection of sporting and recreational facilities are also close by.\nEarly viewing is highly recommended — contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today to arrange a viewing.\n \nFeatures\n<ul>\n <li>3 bedroom, 3 bathroom</li>\n <li>Spacious mid-terrace family home</li>\n <li>C.99 sq.m.</li>\n <li>B3 Energy Rating/ Green Mortgage Potential</li>\n <li>Ample parking</li>\n <li>Private rear garden</li>\n <li>Bright and well-proportioned accommodation</li>\n <li>Highly sought-after development</li>\n <li>Excellent location close to Rathcoole village</li>\n <li>Within easy reach of schools, shops and local amenities</li>\n <li>Excellent transport links</li>\n <li>Easy access to M50 & N7</li>\n <li>Ideal first-time buyer/family home</li>\n <li>Early viewing is highly advised</li>\n</ul>\n\nBER Details\nBER: B3\nDirections\nEircode: D24 EW90"
      },
      {
